{"timestamp": 1779395953.275189, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "Eve, that's a fabrication and everyone needs to slow down before we throw the game away on her word alone.\n\nThink about what she just did. She waited until the very last speech, after Charlie, Alice, and Frank had already committed publicly, to drop a \"gotcha\" that nobody else can verify. That's not a witness account \u2014 that's a frame.\n\nHere's what actually doesn't add up about Eve's story: Alice's timeline put Eve in Electrical at tick 4 with Diana, then Medbay at tick 7, then Upper Engine by tick 10. So Eve is claiming she saw me enter Medbay from Electrical at tick 8 \u2014 but by tick 8 she should have been moving toward Upper Engine to make Alice's tick 10 sighting. Her own \"evidence\" contradicts the timeline she's hiding behind.\n\nAnd ask yourself \u2014 who was actually in Electrical with Diana right before she died? By Alice's account: Alice AND Eve. Alice left. Eve is the one with the cleanest opportunity, and now she's pinning it on the one person without a witness.\n\nI went Weapons, Cafeteria, Medbay. If I had come from Electrical, Charlie would have crossed me on his way in \u2014 he didn't. Charlie himself said he saw nobody fleeing.\n\nEve is the Duck and she's using a late-position lie to railroad me. If I'm wrong, you have me next round. If you're wrong about me, Eve kills again and we lose. Vote Eve."}}
